---
title: "Begin, change rows, and finish a transaction"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Ready to begin
  s1: Transaction active
  s2: Transaction committed
  s3: Transaction with savepoint
  s4: Transaction rolled back
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: You begin a transaction
  s1 --> s2: You commit
  s1 --> s3: You set a savepoint
  s1 --> s4: You roll back
  s3 --> s1: You release the savepoint
  s3 --> s2: You commit
  s3 --> s4: You roll back
